WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,120
Say it quickly

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,840
What's the matter? I'm old and late.

3
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:04,520
I don't know either

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,880
Anyway, you go and take a look, it's too late.

5
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,120
I'm afraid Lin Langtian can't stand it

6
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:17,670
Lin Langtian, stop

7
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:19,830
I'll give you a knife-raising heart

8
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:21,420
I see where is your uncle?

9
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,300
Will I still be alive if I stop?

10
00:00:28,610 --> 00:00:31,540
Isn't this the Holy Son and Eldest Brother? What's going on?

11
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,220
Why did they start fighting again?

12
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:35,780
Let me correct it

13
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:38,530
It’s the Holy Son who is chasing after the elder brother

14
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:43,100
They are all having fun

15
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:44,260
Call the boss over quickly

16
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:46,140
If you go slower, I'll take care of it.

17
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:55,440
Dragon, you are not human

18
00:00:58,010 --> 00:01:00,210
I scolded the Holy Son for not being a human being

19
00:01:00,650 --> 00:01:03,260
You are marrying the way of death again
